**New Methods:**
- `copyToClipboard(text, message)` - Handles clipboard writing with error handling
- `showNotification(text, type)` - Integrates with your UI store's notification system

**Updated Copy Logic:**
- `copySelected()` now calls `copyToClipboard()` instead of directly using `navigator.clipboard`
- Shows contextual messages like "5 cell(s) copied" or "3 row(s) copied"
- Falls back gracefully if store is unavailable

**Notification Features:**
- Uses your existing `$storex.ui.addNotification()` system
- Shows success notifications on copy
- Shows error notifications if clipboard write fails
- Auto-dismisses after 30 seconds (configured in your UI store)
